auto;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;The materials to be used in the construction of the
external surfaces of the extension hereby permitted shall match those used in
the existing building.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:32.6pt;mso-add-space:
