&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraphCxSpLast&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:32.6pt;mso-add-space:auto;
text-align:justify&quot;&gt;To safeguard the character and appearance of the area in
accordance with Core Policy CS1.B of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012) and Policy
DM1 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:32.6pt;mso-add-space:
auto;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;The window(s) in the&amp;nbsp;
flank elevation(s) of the proposed development shall: (a) be of
purpose-made obscure glass, (b) be permanently fixed closed below a height of
1.7m above finished floor level, and shall thereafter be retained in that form.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:32.6pt;mso-add-space:
auto;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;



&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraphCxSpLast&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:32.6pt;mso-add-space:auto;
text-align:justify&quot;&gt;REASON: To safeguard the residential amenities of
neighbouring residents, in accordance with Policy DM1 of the Harrow Development
Management Policies Local Plan (2013).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:32.6pt;mso-add-space:
auto;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;The roof area of the extension hereby permitted shall
not be used as a balcony, roof garden or similar amenity area without the grant
of further specific permission from the local planning authority.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraphCxSpLast&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:32.6pt;mso-add-space:auto;
